### Test Immediate Subscription Upgrade Feature
### Base URL
@base_url = http://localhost:3000
@token = YOUR_AUTH_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Get Current Subscription (to see current plan)
GET {{base_url}}/api/subscriptions/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2. Get Available Plans (to see plan IDs)
GET {{base_url}}/api/subscriptions/plans

###

### 3. Immediate Upgrade - Pro to Max
POST {{base_url}}/api/subscriptions/upgrade
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "newPlanId": "max_monthly",
  "immediate": true,
  "reason": "user_upgrade"
}

###

### 4. Immediate Downgrade - Pro to Plus
POST {{base_url}}/api/subscriptions/upgrade
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "newPlanId": "plus_monthly",
  "immediate": true,
  "reason": "user_downgrade"
}

###

### 5. Scheduled Upgrade (Existing Behavior) - Pro to Max
POST {{base_url}}/api/subscriptions/upgrade
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "newPlanId": "max_monthly",
  "immediate": false,
  "reason": "user_upgrade"
}

###

### 6. Default Behavior (Scheduled) - Omit immediate parameter
POST {{base_url}}/api/subscriptions/upgrade
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "newPlanId": "max_monthly",
  "reason": "user_upgrade"
}

###

### 7. Error Test - Missing newPlanId
POST {{base_url}}/api/subscriptions/upgrade
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "immediate": true,
  "reason": "user_upgrade"
}

###

### 8. Error Test - Same Plan
POST {{base_url}}/api/subscriptions/upgrade
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "newPlanId": "pro_monthly",
  "immediate": true,
  "reason": "user_upgrade"
}

###

### 9. Error Test - Invalid Plan ID
POST {{base_url}}/api/subscriptions/upgrade
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "newPlanId": "invalid_plan_id",
  "immediate": true,
  "reason": "user_upgrade"
}

###

### 10. Check Subscription After Upgrade
GET {{base_url}}/api/subscriptions/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 11. Check Billing History (to see prorated payment)
GET {{base_url}}/api/subscriptions/billing?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Expected Flow for Immediate Upgrade:
### 1. API returns success with immediate: true
### 2. Razorpay processes the change and charges prorated amount
### 3. Razorpay sends subscription.charged webhook
### 4. Webhook handler:
###    - Updates subscription billing period
###    - Expires old credits
###    - Grants new credits
###    - Records payment
### 5. User immediately has new plan and credits

